@startuml
' DOC-3.3-SEQ1 | v0.3 | 日期: 2026-06-06 | 状态: 终审修正
' 文档ID: DOC-3.3 | 文件: user-create-project.seq.puml
' 依赖: architecture.md v0.3, class-diagram.puml v0.5, PRD §6.1/6.2, user-flows Flow1/Flow2
' 覆盖: 用户打开应用 → 模式选择 → 需求对话(需求分析师+UI/UX顾问并行协作) → PRD确认 → 原型预览 → 裁判第一道关 → 架构设计
' 架构说明: 图中AppShell→GuideAgent的forwardToRouter消息在架构依赖图中定义为UI→ROUTE→GUIDE两跳
'   SessionRouter在执行forwardToRouter时透明介入(加载角色→上下文注入→回填), 图中简化为直接消息以保持可读性
'   (依赖图待更新: 补充UI→GUIDE合成路径标注)
' 参与者: User, AppShell, SessionRouter, GuideAgent, RequirementAnalyst, UIUXAdvisor, ArchitectDesigner, EngineeringManager, ProjectDocumentSystem, SnapshotManager

actor User

participant AppShell
participant SessionRouter
participant GuideAgent
participant RequirementAnalyst
participant UIUXAdvisor
participant ArchitectDesigner
participant EngineeringManager
participant ProjectDocumentSystem
participant SnapshotManager
participant JudgeAgent
participant HardConstraintChecker
participant SoftConstraintEvaluator

== 阶段0: 应用启动与模式选择 ==

User -> AppShell : 启动应用
activate AppShell
AppShell -> GuideAgent : forwardToRouter(启动意图)
activate GuideAgent

GuideAgent -> SessionRouter : switchTo(模式选择引导)
activate SessionRouter
SessionRouter -> GuideAgent : backfill(欢迎文案+两道门卡片)
deactivate SessionRouter

GuideAgent --> AppShell : 展示两道门选择页
AppShell --> User : 渲染模式选择卡片
deactivate GuideAgent

User -> AppShell : 点击"快速做一个工具"或"做一个长期维护的项目"
AppShell -> GuideAgent : forwardToRouter(模式选择=快消型/长期迭代型)
activate GuideAgent

GuideAgent -> SnapshotManager : autoTrigger(项目创建)
activate SnapshotManager
SnapshotManager -> ProjectDocumentSystem : createStructure(模板)
activate ProjectDocumentSystem
ProjectDocumentSystem --> SnapshotManager : DirTree
deactivate ProjectDocumentSystem
SnapshotManager --> GuideAgent : 快照已创建
deactivate SnapshotManager

== 阶段1: 需求分析(需求分析师+UI/UX顾问并行协作) ==

GuideAgent -> SessionRouter : switchTo(RequirementAnalyst, contextSummary)
activate SessionRouter
SessionRouter -> GuideAgent : backfill(需求分析师SystemPrompt+上下文摘要)
deactivate SessionRouter

GuideAgent -> RequirementAnalyst : conductInterview(用户首次输入)
activate RequirementAnalyst

loop 每轮对话(最少3-5问，动态上限)
  RequirementAnalyst --> User : Question[] (生活化语言+卡片选项)
  deactivate RequirementAnalyst

  User -> AppShell : 回答/选择/"你帮我决定"
  AppShell -> GuideAgent : forwardToRouter(用户回答)

  GuideAgent -> RequirementAnalyst : conductInterview(用户回答)
  activate RequirementAnalyst

  alt 用户描述涉及UI布局
    RequirementAnalyst -> GuideAgent : 触发UI/UX顾问介入
    GuideAgent -> SessionRouter : switchTo(UIUXAdvisor, contextSummary)
    activate SessionRouter
    SessionRouter -> GuideAgent : backfill(UI/UX顾问SystemPrompt+上下文摘要)
    deactivate SessionRouter

    GuideAgent -> UIUXAdvisor : generatePrototype(当前PRD草稿)
    activate UIUXAdvisor
    UIUXAdvisor --> User : HTML草图嵌入对话区
    deactivate UIUXAdvisor

    User -> AppShell : 在草图上评论/确认
    AppShell -> GuideAgent : forwardToRouter(反馈)
    GuideAgent -> RequirementAnalyst : 视觉反馈→更新功能清单
  end
end

RequirementAnalyst -> GuideAgent : detectCompletion(信息完备)
Note over RequirementAnalyst : 核心功能>=3项且均已明确
deactivate RequirementAnalyst

GuideAgent -> RequirementAnalyst : generatePRD(意图树)
activate RequirementAnalyst
RequirementAnalyst -> ProjectDocumentSystem : 写入 01_PRD/prd.md
deactivate RequirementAnalyst

alt 快消型
  RequirementAnalyst --> User : 需求摘要: "我理解你想做的是[描述]。\n具体包括: [功能1/2/3]。\n不包括: [明确不做的事]。"
  User -> AppShell : "对"/"差不多"/"还要改"
  AppShell -> GuideAgent : forwardToRouter(PRD确认)
  Note over RequirementAnalyst : 用户回复"对"/"差不多"即确认\n回复"还要改"则返回继续对话
else 长期迭代型
  RequirementAnalyst --> User : 完整PRD草案(分章节展示)
  User -> AppShell : 逐章点击"确认"或"修改"
  AppShell -> GuideAgent : forwardToRouter(逐章确认结果)
  Note over RequirementAnalyst : 每章附带"确认"和"修改"入口\n全部章节确认后PRD标记为"已确认"
end

GuideAgent -> SnapshotManager : autoTrigger(PRD确认)
activate SnapshotManager
SnapshotManager -> ProjectDocumentSystem : createSnapshot
deactivate SnapshotManager

== 阶段2: 原型预览与确认 ==

GuideAgent -> SessionRouter : switchTo(UIUXAdvisor, contextSummary)
activate SessionRouter
SessionRouter -> GuideAgent : backfill(UI/UX顾问SystemPrompt+上下文摘要)
deactivate SessionRouter

GuideAgent -> UIUXAdvisor : generatePrototype(完整PRD)
activate UIUXAdvisor
UIUXAdvisor -> UIUXAdvisor : injectDataAiId(html)

loop PRD中每个核心页面
  UIUXAdvisor -> ProjectDocumentSystem : 写入 02_UX_DESIGN/wireframes/page-*.prototype.html
end

alt 长期迭代型
  UIUXAdvisor -> ProjectDocumentSystem : 写入 sitemap.md, design-system.md, interaction-spec.md
end

UIUXAdvisor -> UIUXAdvisor : suggestFeatures(PRD)
Note over UIUXAdvisor : 基于项目类型+行业最佳实践\n主动建议PRD未要求的功能组件\n(如设置页/登录功能), 标注"AI建议"
UIUXAdvisor --> User : 建议列表: "根据你的项目类型,\n我建议加上以下功能——\n你觉得哪些需要保留？"
User -> AppShell : 逐项勾选保留/删除(加减法模式)
AppShell -> GuideAgent : forwardToRouter(用户勾选结果)
Note over UIUXAdvisor : 仅用户保留的建议项\n纳入原型和后续开发

UIUXAdvisor -> UIUXAdvisor : reviewUI(原型截图) → 调用视觉模型自检
UIUXAdvisor --> User : 右侧预览面板展示原型首页

User -> AppShell : 预览交互(点击/浏览)
alt 用户表达满意
  User -> AppShell : "可以""挺好""就这样"
  AppShell -> GuideAgent : forwardToRouter(原型确认)
  UIUXAdvisor --> GuideAgent : 原型已确认
else 用户要求修改
  User -> AppShell : "这个按钮不应该在这里"
  AppShell -> GuideAgent : forwardToRouter(修改意见)
  GuideAgent -> UIUXAdvisor : 更新原型
  UIUXAdvisor -> SnapshotManager : autoTrigger(修改前)
  deactivate UIUXAdvisor
end
deactivate UIUXAdvisor

== 阶段3: 裁判Agent第一道关(仅长期迭代型) ==

alt 长期迭代型
  GuideAgent -> ProjectDocumentSystem : 触发文档审查
  activate ProjectDocumentSystem
  ProjectDocumentSystem -> JudgeAgent : 提交审查(project-root)
  deactivate ProjectDocumentSystem
  activate JudgeAgent
  JudgeAgent -> HardConstraintChecker : executeHardCheck
  activate HardConstraintChecker
  HardConstraintChecker --> JudgeAgent : HardCheckReport
  deactivate HardConstraintChecker

  alt 硬约束不通过
    JudgeAgent --> ProjectDocumentSystem : 退回 + 缺失项清单
    ProjectDocumentSystem --> GuideAgent : 退回通知
    Note over GuideAgent : 修复缺失→重新提交\n长期迭代型不限退回次数
  else 硬约束通过
    JudgeAgent -> SoftConstraintEvaluator : executeSoftEval
    activate SoftConstraintEvaluator
    SoftConstraintEvaluator --> JudgeAgent : SoftEvalReport
    deactivate SoftConstraintEvaluator

    alt 软约束通过
      JudgeAgent -> JudgeAgent : verdict("通过")
      Note over JudgeAgent : 文档体系审查通过,\n可进入架构设计
    else 软约束不通过
      JudgeAgent --> ProjectDocumentSystem : 退回 + 矛盾点 + 改进建议
      activate ProjectDocumentSystem
      ProjectDocumentSystem --> GuideAgent : 退回通知
      deactivate ProjectDocumentSystem
      Note over GuideAgent : 修复后重新提交
    end
  end
  deactivate JudgeAgent
end

== 阶段4: 架构设计(模式差异化) ==

alt 快消型
  GuideAgent -> SessionRouter : skipToBackstage(ArchitectDesigner)
  activate SessionRouter
  SessionRouter -> GuideAgent : backfill(架构师SystemPrompt, 无UI渲染)
  deactivate SessionRouter

  GuideAgent -> ArchitectDesigner : selectTech+generatePUML(后台, 不展示)
  activate ArchitectDesigner
  ArchitectDesigner -> ProjectDocumentSystem : 写入 architecture.md + .puml (简版)
  ArchitectDesigner -> GuideAgent : 架构方案完成
  deactivate ArchitectDesigner

  Note over User : 用户看到"AI正在设计技术方案..."\n架构师全程隐于后台

  GuideAgent -> SessionRouter : skipToBackstage(EngineeringManager)
  activate SessionRouter
  SessionRouter -> GuideAgent : backfill(工程经理SystemPrompt, 无UI渲染)
  deactivate SessionRouter

  GuideAgent -> EngineeringManager : configureTeam+planSprints(自动)
  activate EngineeringManager
  EngineeringManager -> ProjectDocumentSystem : 写入 team-config.md (全栈+测试)
  EngineeringManager -> GuideAgent : 团队配置完成
  deactivate EngineeringManager

else 长期迭代型
  GuideAgent -> SessionRouter : switchTo(ArchitectDesigner, contextSummary)
  activate SessionRouter
  SessionRouter -> GuideAgent : backfill(架构师SystemPrompt+上下文摘要)
  deactivate SessionRouter

  GuideAgent -> ArchitectDesigner : 跳到前台, 展示技术选型方案
  activate ArchitectDesigner
  ArchitectDesigner --> User : "建议选择[方案A]和[方案B]——\n前者适合你的场景因为..., 后者更灵活但也更复杂"

  User -> AppShell : 选择方案/确认
  AppShell -> GuideAgent : forwardToRouter(用户选择)

  ArchitectDesigner -> ArchitectDesigner : generatePUML(确认的选型)
  ArchitectDesigner -> ProjectDocumentSystem : 写入 architecture.md + class-diagram.puml + sequence-diagrams/
  ArchitectDesigner -> SnapshotManager : autoTrigger(架构确认)
  ArchitectDesigner -> GuideAgent : 架构方案确认
  deactivate ArchitectDesigner

  GuideAgent -> SessionRouter : switchTo(EngineeringManager, contextSummary)
  activate SessionRouter
  SessionRouter -> GuideAgent : backfill(工程经理SystemPrompt+上下文摘要)
  deactivate SessionRouter

  GuideAgent -> EngineeringManager : 跳到前台, 展示Sprint拆分建议
  activate EngineeringManager
  EngineeringManager --> User : "第一个版本先做[核心A和B],\n预计能看到[效果]。第二个版本再加[C和D]。\n你觉得这个节奏可以吗？"

  User -> AppShell : 调整优先级/确认
  AppShell -> GuideAgent : forwardToRouter(用户决策)

  EngineeringManager -> ProjectDocumentSystem : 写入 sprint-plan.md + team-config.md + workflow.md
  EngineeringManager -> SnapshotManager : autoTrigger(规划确认)
  EngineeringManager -> GuideAgent : 工程规划确认
  deactivate EngineeringManager
end

== 阶段4: 文档交接 ==

GuideAgent -> ProjectDocumentSystem : validateStructure(完整目录)
activate ProjectDocumentSystem
ProjectDocumentSystem --> GuideAgent : 结构校验通过
deactivate ProjectDocumentSystem

GuideAgent -> GuideAgent : 发起交接 → 裁判Agent流程(参见SEQ-4)

deactivate GuideAgent
deactivate AppShell

@enduml
